<title>SYRIA: Port conditions update - Syria/Bangladesh/Pakistan.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Syria/Bangladesh/Pakistan.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>SYRIA, Lattakia and Tartous, Sept 14 - Waiting time presently 24 hours.</p>
<p>BANGLADESH, Chittagong, Sept 18 - There has been an amicable settlement between the truck drivers union and the dock labourers and cargo operations resumed at 1400 hrs, Sept 17 at the main jetty no.1 to 13.</p>
<p>KARACHI, Sept 23 - Four vessels waiting off port. One general cargo, waiting three days. One fertiliser, waiting 10 days. One tanker, waiting three days. Three other vessels laid up off port for own reasons.</p>
</text>
